== Documented changes ==
=== Changes ===
* Adjusted the behavior of {{e|Cod Worm}}s staying hidden for long periods of time.
* Adjusted the behavior of {{e|Kineti}} to only use their rock-grabbing action if they are on screen with the player.
* Adjusted {{e|Blood Cultist}}s to not fire their blood attack from off screen.
* Lowered the tear height of red champion {{e|Mega Fatty}}'s puke attack so that it doesn't always fly over Isaac's head.
* {{e|The Siren}} will no longer charm {{i|Isaac's Heart}} or {{c|Lilith}}'s {{i|Incubus}}.
* The [[Amnesia]] horse pill will now unidentify all previously identified pills.
* {{c|Tainted Magdalene}}'s bleeding hearts now provide half the charge of a regular heart container when used with {{i|Sharp Plug}}.
* {{c|Tainted ???}} will now swap poops and keys when using a [[Bombs Are Key]] pill.
* Added a 1% chance for {{p|X - Wheel of Fortune}} to spawn a {{m|Crane Game}}.
* Gave {{i|Punching Bag}} back his ability to block shots.
* Removed {{i|Glowing Hourglass}} and {{i|Book of Shadows}} from the {{c|Tainted Lost}} pool.
* Using {{i|Meat Cleaver}} on an [[Angel]] will now award only one [[Key Piece]].
* {{i|Delirious}} has returned to a fixed 12-charge item. Bosses have had their health and damage overhauled. They will take 1 damage per hit and 5 damage from explosions. Spikes, fires and red poops do no damage to them. Their health will deteriorate steadily and their color will slowly turn more gray until they reach 1 health.
* {{e|Delirium}} Mom's Foot is no longer sped up when Delirium gets enraged. A minimum delay of one second has been added between transforming into the foot and the stomp attack. While in Mom's Foot form, Delirium cannot fire additional projectiles. These same behaviors also apply to Satan's Foot.
* Replaced {{i|Mars}}' shield bubble with i-frames which will still allow free entrance into {{r|Curse Room}}s but will not allow free plays to {{m|Devil Beggar}}s and {{m|Blood Donation Machine}}s. Impact from a Mars dash no longer creates fissures that destroy rocks. It instead creates a ring of fire that applies the [[burn]] status effect.
* {{i|Jar of Wisps}} has returned to a 12-charge item. Its first use will grant two wisps and every wisp spawned has a high chance to be of a special variety.
* Pausing the game with {{i|Glitched Crown}} will not pause the item rotation, and will instead give the rotation a burst of speed.
* Adjusted the proc chances of several {{i|Abyss}} locusts that were too powerful.
* Knockback from farting locusts has been increased.
* Adjusted the stat boost from {{i|Star of Bethlehem}} to match {{i|Hallowed Ground}}.
* Wisps spawned from {{i|The Bean}} and {{i|Kidney Bean}} will now expire when changing rooms.
* Completing a {{r|Secret Room}} with a {{e|Greed}} fight will now allow access to adjacent {{r|Challenge Room}}s.
* Added enemy spawn indicators for {{r|Boss Rush}}, {{r|Challenge Room}}s, {{e|Great Gideon}} and {{mode|greed|greedier}} [[Greed Mode]].
* {{e|Golden Key}}s and {{e|Golden Bomb}}s can now be spent at the {{m|Key Master}} and {{m|Bomb Bum}} to guarantee an item drop.
* Item charging with {{m|Battery Bum}} while holding multiple active items now prioritizes filling up each item before overcharging.
* {{i|Pause}} now synergizes with {{i|Black Powder}} allowing circles to be drawn while a room is paused.
* Added a very low (1%) chance for most bosses to drop a thematic item on death.
** Items are dropped as choice pedestals tied to the normal boss item, while trinkets are able to be taken freely along with the normal boss item.
