* Increased the range of {{i|Dr. Fetus}} with {{i|Number One}} and {{i|Pluto}}.
* {{i|The Ludovico Technique}} now grants a .2 shot speed increase.
* If the {{e|Mega Satan}} door has been been opened, using {{i|Forget Me Now}} and restarting the floor will keep door opened.
* Increased the rarity of {{i|D20}} in the Greed {{r|Shop}}.
* Added an option in options.ini to disable the [[Ascent]] voiceover.
* Fully rerolling a character with {{i|D4}}, {{i|D100}}, {{r|Dice Room}}, {{i|Missing No.}}, etc. will no longer reroll the starting passive items of a character if they have unlocked them. Using a {{p|XVII - The Stars?}} card will also not consume starting passives. Starting active items can be rerolled. The items that will not be rerolled are:
** {{c|Cain}}: {{i|Lucky Foot}}.
** {{c|Eve}}: {{i|Whore of Babylon}} and {{i|Dead Bird}}.
** {{c|Samson}}: {{i|Bloody Lust}}.
** {{c|Lazarus}}: {{i|Anemic}}.
** {{c|The Lost}}: {{i|Holy Mantle}}.
** {{c|Lilith}}: {{i|Incubus}} and {{i|Cambion Conception}}.
** {{c|Bethany}}: {{i|Book of Virtues}}.
* Using {{i|Clicker}} to change characters now provides that character's intrinsic passive items. These items are lost when changing characters again. Reduced the chance of Clicker removing the most recently acquired item to 50%.
* Added various new sound effects:
** Using {{i|Abyss}}, {{i|The Boomerang}}, {{i|Box of Friends}}, {{i|Brown Nugget}}, {{i|Converter}}, {{i|Crooked Penny}}, {{i|Flip}}, {{i|Glowing Hourglass}}, {{i|Mega Bean}}, and {{i|Mom's Bottle of Pills}}.
** {{i|Big Chubby}} and {{i|Little Chubby}} attacking.
** {{i|Bumbo}} leveling up.
** Entering a {{i|Card Reading}} portal and ambient sounds for portals.
** {{i|Cracked Orb}} and {{i|Gnawed Leaf}} activating.
** Kicking {{i|Cube Baby}}.
** {{i|Dark Bum}} paying out.
** {{i|Doctor's Remote}} missile warning before landing.
** {{i|Eraser}} hitting an enemy.
** {{i|Glitter Bombs}} bomb exploding.
** Taking and throwing an {{i|IBS}} poop.
** {{i|Infamy}} deflecting a shot.
** {{i|Lil Haunt}} chasing an enemy.
** {{i|Linger Bean}} spawning a cloud.
** Firing a {{i|Little Horn}} tear.
* Daily Runs:
** Using {{i|Meat Cleaver}} during daily runs will cause each resulting split monster to give half of its normal score.
** [[Frozen]] enemies will count as being killed and will award score in daily runs.
** Killing {{e|Uriel}} and {{e|Gabriel}} during a daily run will now only award score the first time each is killed.
** Stage bonus in daily runs has been modified to accommodate different end goals.
** Stage bonus is fixed for each stage. XL stages now award the stage bonus for both floors. Using a {{i|Forget Me Now}} or a 5-pip {{r|Dice Room}} will not award additional stage bonus.
** Using a {{i|Forget Me Now}} during a daily run will now award half the exploration bonus during the repeated floor. Any additional replayed floors will not grant any exploration bonus.
** Fixed an issue where using {{i|Forget Me Now}} on the final floor of a daily run would result in an incorrect time on the score summary.
** Fixed an issue where quitting a practice daily would reset the daily win streak.
** Exploration bonus from red rooms opened with {{i|Red Key}}, {{t|Crystal Key}}, {{p|Soul of Cain}} and {{p|XVIII - The Moon?}} is capped at 2,000 points, after which they award no exploration bonus.
** Added Alt Path, {{s|Home}} and {{e|Delirium}} to the daily rotation. The new schedule is:
*** Monday: {{e|Mother}}.
*** Tuesday: [[Tainted Characters]].
*** Wednesday: {{e|Delirium}}.
*** Thursday: {{s|Home}}.
*** Friday: [[Hard Mode]].
*** Saturday: Grab Bag (random character, end goal, difficulty).
*** Sunday: {{e|Mega Satan}}.

=== Fixes ===
* Fixed an issue where {{i|Glowing Hourglass}} was not expending charges correctly in some scenarios
* Fixed an issue where {{t|Gigante Bean}} would apply to enemy farts
* Fixed an issue with {{c|Jacob and Esau}} classic controls that would cause cards and active items to be used together
* Fixed an issue where dashing items were not properly stopping when attacking {{e|Mega Satan}} head-on
* Fixed an issue where {{i|R Key}} could be used while picking up an active item, allowing both the active to be acquired and the R Key to be used
* Fixed an issue where {{e|Wall Creep}} and {{e|Blind Creep}} would infinitely devolve into each other
* Fixed an issue where using {{i|Genesis}} after a completed {{e|Ultra Greed}} fight would completely reset the floor
* Fixed several issues which allowed {{i|Lemegeton}} wisps to exceed their cap
* Fixed an issue where {{i|Lemegeton}} item effects were retained after using {{i|Genesis}}
* Fixed an issue where mapping items granted by {{i|Lemegeton}} would not activate until entering the next floor
* Fixed an issue where shrunken champion enemies could still damage Isaac when killed
* Fixed an issue where {{c|Tainted Eve}} would not refund the appropriate amount of health if {{e|Rotten Heart}}s were turned into clots
* Fixed an issue where leaving the room while a {{m|Crane Game}} was paying out could result in the item dropping but the machine not advancing
* Fixed an issue where [[Tainted characters]] would not receive charges to their eternal item from {{m|Battery Bum}} unless they were holding another active item
* Fixed an issue where taking too many of a single pill type could prevent the run from being exited and continued
* Fixed an issue where {{i|Vanishing Twin}} could spawn an item pedestal on the same tile as the trapdoor
* Fixed an issue where {{i|Dead Bird}} could persist between rooms if the player had only {{e|Soul Heart}}s
* Fixed an issue where {{i|Monstro's Lung}} would fire arching shots from {{i|Ipecac}} and {{i|Haemolacria}} directly at Isaac's feet
* Fixed a softlock that could occur when using {{i|Eraser}} on {{e|Dogma}}
* Fixed an exploit with {{e|The Bloat}}'s hitbox that allowed players to safely stand on top of him while repeating the same attack
* Fixed a softlock that would occur when using {{i|Dataminer}} to reroll {{i|Dad's Note}}
* Fixed an issue where {{i|Echo Chamber}}'s stored effects were lost when exiting and resuming a run
* Fixed an audible skip when looping the {{e|Mother}} fight, {{e|Isaac}} fight and {{r|Devil Room}} music
* Fixed an issue where jumping into the {{e|Mother}} fight played a teleport sound effect
* Fixed a desync with {{i|Plum Flute}} and {{i|Book of Virtues}}
* Fixed an issue where status effects were double applied in some cases when entering a new room
* Fixed an issue where players could get golden trinkets from champion monsters before they were unlocked
* Fixed an issue where bombs could be dropped when typing in online chat
* Fixed an issue where {{i|Lil Portal}} could spawn directly in front of doorways
* Fixed some issues with {{t|Found Soul}} and Clot familiar positioning when teleporting between rooms
* Fixed an issue where {{t|Found Soul}} was able to get and lose {{i|Abyss}} locusts
* Fixed an issue where {{i|Epiphora}} was not resetting when changing firing direction
* Fixed another instance where the {{i|D4}} could change the pool ID of items, allowing them to be rerolled into a specific pool
* Fixed an issue where {{i|Mama Mega!}} and {{t|Flat File}} effects could persist into deathmatch
* Fixed a crash when using {{i|Clicker}}, gulped trinkets and {{c|Jacob and Esau}}
* Fixed an issue where {{i|Milk!}} was higher priority in the familiar order than {{i|Incubus}}
* Fixed incorrect challenge names displaying when creating an online game
* Selected challenge name now appears in lobby list details
* Fixed an issue where the number of {{i|Quints}} could be exceeded and turned into followers for {{c|Tainted Lazarus}}
* Fixed an issue where the chance for {{i|Glitter Bombs}} to drop a consumable was reset when exiting and continuing a run
* Fixed an issue where {{i|Glitched Crown}} removed items from pools when encountering story items
* Fixed several crashes that could occur with a {{i|C Section}} and {{i|Spirit Sword}} combo
* Removed {{i|Urn of Souls}} from {{i|Metronome}} payouts
* {{t|Perfection}} progress is no longer interrupted by {{i|Lost Soul}}, {{i|Strawman}} or {{p|Soul of the Forgotten}} taking damage
* {{i|Guppy's Eye}} now correctly updates the contents of chests when the {{i|D1}} is used
* Fixed an issue where kills from a {{i|Gello}} whip would not give {{i|Jar of Flies}} a fly
* Fixed an issue where the {{s|???}} {{r|Shop}} was not an appropriate variant when playing {{c|Tainted Keeper}}
* Adjusted {{e|Mega Satan}}'s phase 2 fire attacks making their visual line up more closely to their hitbox
* Fixed [[frozen]] enemies not properly triggering the on-kill effects of {{i|Charm of the Vampire}}, {{i|Lusty Blood}}, {{i|Toxic Shock}}, {{i|Jar of Flies}}, {{t|Samson's Lock}}, {{t|Eve's Bird Foot}}, {{t|Bat Wing}}, {{t|Sigil of Baphomet}}, {{i|Vasculitis}}, {{i|Death's List}}, {{i|Berserk!}}, {{i|Red Stew}}, {{i|4.5 Volt}} and {{i|Jumper Cables}}

== Undocumented changes ==
=== Changes ===
* Perma [[charm|charmed]] enemies now contribute to the score.
* {{m|Devil Beggar}}s now give +35% devil chance when blown.
* {{i|Sulfuric Acid}} / {{i|Terra}} + any laser can now destroy doors.

